[url=http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/28195285/762e1072ddd4c71237a1643c6c7dbd6b68b72147.jpg][img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/28195285/f32ee6d2e43bd31670a32b0e9493232583d86bd6.jpg[/img][/url]

Released! We’ve been working on the game for a year and now we need all of your support. Thanks to all of you who followed the project since it'd been approved by Steam Greenlight. The game is now available with a 20% discount for another two weeks at a cost of $12.

Our game is a warm and cozy RPG that combines classic fantasy and English folklore. There're 20 hours of gameplay and full set of game mechanics in the early access version. We don't plan to stop there - we’re going to work on new functionality and detailed improvement of all game mechanics soon. Adventures of the main character Arthur are connected with the well-known King Arthur's legend. The narrative of "The Willy-Nilly Knight" doesn't retell the old story, it reveals a completely new plot with an unexpected ending to the players. 

Key features:
A well - developed tactical system;
Equipment influences the gameplay;
Big and colorful world;
Lots of funny “easter eggs” and references.

